cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or protocol, please cite it as below."
title: "ONTO-PROBE: probing the limits of ontological innovation in large language models"
type: software
authors:
  - name: "matrixNeo76"
abstract: >-
  A research protocol and toolkit to test whether large language models can generate
  conceptually novel structures or only recombine known archetypes. Includes theory,
  a 50-task benchmark, a blind multi-judge evaluation pipeline over APIs, and a
  Contrastive Activation Addition smoke test.
version: "0.3.2"
date-released: "2026-10-11"
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/matrixNeo76/ontoprobe"
keywords:
  - large language models
  - ontological novelty
  - activation steering
  - benchmark
  - evaluation
